    "detailed_description": "Lover is a first-person psychological horror game.<br>Presented in a nostalgic and retro environment, player will uncover the cause of the illness through reincarnation and overcome psychological issues.<br>Before darkness consumes your world, find those unspeakable secrets as you face the cold house and shattered reality.<br><br><strong>If you hear the dark transition sound effect, it means that the progress of the current level has been completed and you can go to the next level.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>A complex relationship, a dark secret, a moment of confusion leading to a deadly outcome.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759710/extras/_Description_Story_640-360.GIF?t=1716096282\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment</h2>Presented in a nostalgic and retro environment with a minimalist interface to provide the most authentic and immersive experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759710/extras/_Description_Environment_640-360.GIF?t=1716096282\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Under the player's mental illness, losing sanity will lead to death, but there are still ways to avoid it.<br>Before losing your sanity, make use of your time to piece together the story, find reasonable answers, <br>and stay away from any enemies attempting to take your life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759710/extras/_Description_Feature_640-360.GIF?t=1716096282\" /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Lover is a first-person psychological horror game.<br>Presented in a nostalgic and retro environment, player will uncover the cause of the illness through reincarnation and overcome psychological issues.<br>Before darkness consumes your world, find those unspeakable secrets as you face the cold house and shattered reality.<br><br><strong>If you hear the dark transition sound effect, it means that the progress of the current level has been completed and you can go to the next level.</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>A complex relationship, a dark secret, a moment of confusion leading to a deadly outcome.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759710/extras/_Description_Story_640-360.GIF?t=1716096282\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environment</h2>Presented in a nostalgic and retro environment with a minimalist interface to provide the most authentic and immersive experience.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759710/extras/_Description_Environment_640-360.GIF?t=1716096282\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>Under the player's mental illness, losing sanity will lead to death, but there are still ways to avoid it.<br>Before losing your sanity, make use of your time to piece together the story, find reasonable answers, <br>and stay away from any enemies attempting to take your life.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2759710/extras/_Description_Feature_640-360.GIF?t=1716096282\" /></span>",
